{"availability":"available","full":"moleculerjs/moleculer","name":"moleculer","description":":rocket: Progressive microservices framework for Node.js","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":6377,"forks":605,"created":"2017-02-17T11:11:35Z","updated":"2026-09-07T18:57:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://moleculer.services/","topics":["distributed-systems","microservice","microservice-framework","microservices","moleculer","nodejs"],"demo":"https://codesandbox.io/s/ky5lj09jv?fontsize=14","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:10:07.287Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:10:07.287Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:10:07.287Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:47:51.301Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Node.js","url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome-nodejs"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T05:47:51.301Z","stars":6377,"forks":605},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:10:07.287Z","stars":6377,"forks":605}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Moleculer is a fast, modern and powerful microservices framework for Node.js. It helps you to build efficient, reliable & scalable services. Moleculer provides many features for building and managing your microservices.","Moleculer gives you the distributed-systems layer as part of the framework, so you don't have to run a platform to get it:"],"features":["No orchestrator required. Nodes find each other over the transporter (NATS, Redis, Kafka, MQTT, AMQP — or plain TCP with no broker at all). Service discovery is a built-in registry, not Consul, etcd or a service mesh.","Scale by starting another process. Every broker balances requests and events across the instances it can see (round-robin, random, CPU-usage, latency, sharding) with zero configuration.","Fault tolerance is a broker option. Timeout, retry, circuit breaker, bulkhead and fallback are configuration, not five more dependencies.","The same code from one process to many. Start as a modular monolith (transporter: null), split later by moving services to another process — the service code and the broker.call() sites stay the same.","Batteries included, and pluggable. Caching, parameter validation, metrics, tracing, serializers, loggers and middlewares all ship with it, and all of them can be swapped."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moleculerjs/moleculer/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"83d3f51aa8ea42013922286d695c0b7615432a0514f245a37a03f94c5d5c5e14","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T05:47:51.301Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:47:51.301Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Moleculer is a fast, modern and powerful microservices framework for Node.js. It helps you to build efficient, reliable & scalable services. Moleculer provides many features for building and managing your microservices.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moleculerjs/moleculer/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"83d3f51aa8ea42013922286d695c0b7615432a0514f245a37a03f94c5d5c5e14","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moleculerjs/moleculer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:47:51.301Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-07T18:57:52Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moleculerjs/moleculer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T11:32:22.612Z","hash":"83d3f51aa8ea42013922286d695c0b7615432a0514f245a37a03f94c5d5c5e14","originalBytes":12572,"storedBytes":12572,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["moleculer","service","broker","add","built-in","const","servicebroker","pluggable","transporter","create","nats","number","process","services","amqp","another","broker.start","call","console","datadog","event","many","math","moleculerjs","name","new","parameter","patreon","redis","registry","require","same","start","support","action","actions","architecture","assets","async","breaker","broker.call","broker.createservice","bulkhead","caching","